            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eh’ imisi izoza, ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize, nzotēza inzara mu gihugu, ntizoba ar’ inzara y’ivyo kurya cank’ inyota y’amazi, arikw izoba ar’ iyo kwumva amajambo yanje, jewe Uhoraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "AMO.4.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Am 4:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi bazonyavuta bakubite ku kiyaga baje ku kindi; bazojarajara bakubite n’i burārūko baje n’i burasirazuba, kugira ngo barondere ijambo ry’Uhoraho, yamara ntibazoribona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kur’ uwo musi inkumi nziza‐nziza bo n’abasore bazorabikwa n’inyota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
